      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 chain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 chain — Apple Silicon (h3.c)\nGeneration runs in a persistent native [h3.c](https://github.com/antirez/h3.c) worker that keeps the model and its caches loaded across clips and runs. Build it once: `make -C custom_nodes/ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Metal-Chain H3_DIR=/path/to/h3.c`.\n\n`model_dir` is the MiniMax-H3 snapshot (with `FL2VA/`), absolute or relative to `models/`.\n\n- **prompts**: connect one text node per clip; a new `prompt_N` slot appears as you connect one\n- **num_clips**: 0 = one clip per prompt\n- **style** (optional, connect a text node): appended to every prompt\n- **denoise_steps**: actual h3.c denoising passes (8 by default)\n- **color_match** 0.5–1.0 keeps skin tone stable across clips\n\n**Save Video** saves the merged video (set its name with `filename_prefix`). Generated clips are cached in `output/h3_cache/`. Change one prompt and run again: only that clip and the following ones are regenerated."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
